>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `QUICKCHECK_TAC`

``` hol4
Refute.QUICKCHECK_TAC : Abbrev.tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Quickchecks the current tactic goal for a counterexample.

`QUICKCHECK_TAC` is `REFUTE_TAC_WITH [upd_search QuickcheckBackends]`:
it runs only the `exhaustive`, `random`, and `narrowing` backends, with
every other field of `!Refute.the_config` as read when the tactic is
applied.  It prints the resulting `Counterexample`, `NoCounterexample`,
or `Unknown` report and then behaves as `ALL_TAC`, never closing or
altering the goal; a counterexample is not a tactic failure.  `quiet`
and `expect` are honoured.

### Failure

Fails only when a non-default `expect` field is not met.  Interrupts
are re-raised.

